# .NET does not read .env files. Configuration is layered in this order, with
# later sources winning:
#
#   appsettings.json          committed defaults (secrets intentionally blank)
#   appsettings.{Environment}.json
#   environment variables      MongoDb__ConnectionString  (note the __ separator)
#   dotnet user-secrets        MongoDb:ConnectionString    (recommended locally)
#
# Do NOT commit real credentials. Use user-secrets, which stores them in
# %APPDATA%\Microsoft\UserSecrets outside the repository:
#
#   cd server/src/Lucid.Api
#   dotnet user-secrets set "MongoDb:ConnectionString" "<your-uri>"
#   dotnet user-secrets set "MongoDb:DatabaseName" "lucid"
#   dotnet user-secrets set "Jwt:Key" "<at least 32 characters>"
#
# The equivalent environment variable names, if you prefer those:
#
#   MongoDb__ConnectionString
#   MongoDb__DatabaseName
#   Jwt__Key
#   Jwt__Issuer
#   Jwt__Audience
#   S3__Bucket
#   S3__Region
#   S3__Endpoint
#   S3__AccessKey
#   S3__SecretKey

# MongoDB Atlas example (replace user, password and database name):
# mongodb+srv://<user>:<password>@<cluster-host>/<database>?retryWrites=true&w=majority

# Local Docker Compose default:
# mongodb://localhost:27017
